flowchart LR
  FE[templates and static/js views] <-->|JSON and SSE| MAIN[app/main.py and API routers]
  MAIN --> AUTH[app/auth.py: optional write login]
  MAIN --> PAY[schemas and services/payloads.py]
  MAIN --> SCH[services/scheduler.py and events.py]
  SCH --> MON[services/monitoring.py]
  MON --> SAT[satellite/chain.py, stac.py and copernicus.py]
  SAT --> GRID[satellite/grid.py and provider.py]
  MON --> ANA[services/analysis.py]
  ANA --> VOC[app/vocabulary.py]
  MON --> ML[ml/inference.py, preprocessing.py and U-Nets]
  MON --> CTX[services/context.py]
  MON --> EV[services/evidence.py]
  MON --> ALERT[services/alerting.py and dispatch.py]
  ALERT --> REPORT[services/reporting.py]
  MAIN --> REPORT
  MON --> ORM[models.py and database.py]
  ALERT --> ORM
  MAIN --> ORM
  ORM --> DB[(SQLite)]
  MAIN --> SYSTEM[services/system.py and model registry]
  DATA[data_tools and training] -->|Checkpoints and measured reports| ML
  DATA --> SYSTEM
